message: "If you use or write about Ganpan, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ganpan: signage for AI agents"
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Seunghun
    alias: engmung
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22849147
repository-code: "https://github.com/engmung/ganpan"
url: "https://ganpan.org"
abstract: >-
  A convention for signage that AI agents can read. The owner of a place,
  an object or a project puts up a small set of pages at /ganpan on their
  own address, and a guest types that address into the AI they already use.
  The owner builds no AI. Draft v0.1, not yet validated in the field.
  The repository holds the convention text, the source of ganpan.org
  including the sign for Ganpan itself, a no-dependency static build, and
  a log of the first tests in the ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini apps.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - signage
